      "description": "WELCOME TO JD STATUS\nLooking for rewards?! JD Sports is bringing you the ultimate loyalty app, which rewards you every time you shop*! Earn JD Cash when you bag the biggest brands in the game, including Nike, adidas and loads more. As a member, the app will be home to your JD STATUS QR code that you can scan at the till in-store to earn JD Cash! Or link your JD Sports and JD STATUS accounts to earn when you shop on the JD app or website. Build up the balance in your wallet and use your JD Cash to save on future purchases.\n\nEARN 10% JD CASH WHEN YOU SIGN UP  \nJD STATUS members start earning from the first time they shop! Once you’ve signed up to JD STATUS for free in the app, you’ll unlock 10% JD Cash as your first reward. The first time you make a purchase, you’ll bag 10% of the value back in your balance as JD Cash, instead of the usual 1%. It’s our way of saying thanks! \n\nGET 1% JD CASH ON ALL PURCHASES \nWe’ll reward you every time you shop! Each time you make a purchase at a participating JD store or online, you’ll earn 1% JD Cash, which all adds up! Keep an eye out for special offers and boosted rates where you can bank even more to boost your wallet’s balance. \n\nBOOSTED JD CASH DAYS   \nBuild the balance in your JD STATUS Wallet even quicker with special offers – exclusively available to JD STATUS members! These limited-time deals mean a boosted JD Cash rate, so you can bank even more when you’re shopping your favourite brands at JD. Make sure your app notifications are switched on so you’re in the loop each time new boosts drop! \n\nSTUDENTS GET MORE \nVerify as a student in the JD STATUS app and you'll earn at least 5% JD Cash on every purchase you make online or in-store! Plus, watch out for special boosts and bonuses, exclusively for our student members.\n\nYOUR PERSONAL JD STATUS WALLET  \nThe JD STATUS app is home to your JD STATUS Wallet. You don’t need to worry about carrying a loyalty card around with you, as you’ve got access to your rewards 24/7 right here on the app. From checking your balance to redeeming your JD Cash, your rewards are always at your fingertips! \n\nMaking it extra easy for you, you can also add your JD STATUS QR code to your Apple Wallet for quick access – even if you’ve no internet connection!  \n\nReady to access JD STATUS benefits? Join JD STATUS today and start earning every time you shop at JD Sports! \n\n*Available in JD Sports stores and online across the UK, Republic of Ireland and France.",
